# Read by `next build`, and only by `next build`. NEXT_PUBLIC_* is inlined into
# the bundle by the compiler, so this value is baked into the deployed pages
# rather than read from the Worker at request time — which is why it lives here
# and not in `wrangler.jsonc` under `vars`, where it would look authoritative
# and do nothing.
#
# Committed on purpose. It is a public URL, and leaving it out would mean a
# fresh clone's `npm run deploy:web` silently ships a site pointing at
# 127.0.0.1 — a build that succeeds and then fails in every visitor's browser.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE=https://hoopslab-api-production.kutlumizrak.workers.dev
